  <p id="c-jinshu-064-simabao:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-064-simabao:p001:m0000" ref="czx_7wv_kcl">寶</persName>字弘文，曆秘書監、太常、左將軍、散騎常侍、護軍將軍。宋興，以為金紫光祿大夫，降為西豐侯，食邑千戶。</p>
